WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
After midnight, the market belongs to the radio repairman.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Every shelf hums. Every dial points to a station that closed years ago.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Emeka: People bring me dead radios. I bring back the voices inside.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[Static swells, then clears into a faint dance-band melody.]

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Some nights a stranger waits an hour just to hear one song from his childhood.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Emeka: That is the job. Not fixing the machine. Giving the memory somewhere to land.
